                                  QUERY PLAN                                  
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 GroupAggregate
   Group Key: ((path)::text)
   ->  Sort
         Sort Key: ((path)::text)
         ->  Custom Scan (ParadeDB Base Scan) on cast_paths
               Table: cast_paths
               Index: cast_paths_idx
               Exec Method: NormalScanExecState
               Scores: false
               Full Index Scan: true
               Tantivy Query: {"with_index":{"query":{"all":{"field":"id"}}}}
(11 rows)

SELECT path::text, COUNT(*) FROM cast_paths
WHERE id @@@ pdb.all() GROUP BY path::text ORDER BY 1;
WARNING:  Aggregate Scan (DataFusion) not used: GROUP BY item 1 is a cast; only plain columns and indexed expressions are pushed down (table: cast_paths)
    path     | count 
